      "alttext": "\\displaystyle\\leq C\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})\\,\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}\\,.",
      "id": "A2.E29.m2",
      "region": "corrector-change-B4-consumer-proof",
      "source_RAW_range_end_exclusive": [
        937335,
