      "alttext": "\\displaystyle\\leq 2\\rho^{2}\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}f_{\\mathsf{V}}\\|^{2}+2(1-\\rho)^{2}\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}r\\|^{2}\\leq C\\Lambda_{\\rho}\\,\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}\\,.",
